{"title":"Ace of Spades Halloween Dance Party","startsAt":"2026-10-31T21:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-11-01T00:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"NOTE: This is a ticketed event.\n\nTickets here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ace-of-spades-halloween-dance-party-tickets-2001597912237?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true\n\nHalloween after dark! Dance, dress up and celebrate with DJ Infin8te at Ace of Spades Lounge in the heart of downtown Toronto.\n\nGet ready for a **Halloween night out like no other!** 🎃🖤 Join us Saturday, October 31 at **Ace of Spades Lounge** in Toronto for a spooky, stylish **Halloween Dance Party** featuring DJ Infin8te.\n\nThe night kicks off at **9PM**, so come dressed to impress—or scare! Whether you're single, bringing friends, or looking to meet new people, this is your chance to hit the dance floor, enjoy the Halloween atmosphere and make some new connections.\n\nExpect a night of **music, dancing, cocktails, costumes and Halloween vibes** in the intimate atmosphere of Ace of Spades Lounge. Put on your best costume, bring your energy and get ready to dance the night away.\n\n📍 **Ace of Spades Lounge**\n536 Manning Ave, Toronto\n📅 **Saturday, October 31**\n🕘 **9PM**\n🎧 **Featuring DJ Infin8te**\n🎃 **Costumes encouraged but not mandatory**","venue":{"name":"Ace of Spades Lounge and Events","address":"536 Manning Ave Lower Level, Toronto, ON M6G 2V7, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.660397,"lng":-79.414754,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Do Stuff and Make Friends in Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/d/c/3/highres_536196291.jpeg"}